---
interface Props {
  emailId: string;
}
const { emailId } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="audit-pack-content">
  <div class="audit-pack-art" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="audit-pack-sheet"><span>PDF</span><strong>Warehouse audit</strong><p>Scope<br />Evidence<br />Actions</p><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="audit-pack-workbook"><span>EXCEL</span><strong>A working record<br />for the whole review</strong><div class="audit-sheet-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
  </div>
  <p>The planned pack will bring these 28 checks into an editable working record and printable floor sheets, with examples to help you record findings and assign follow-up.</p>
  <ul class="audit-pack-contents">
    <li><strong>Editable Excel workbook:</strong> plan the review, record evidence and track findings, action owners and verification.</li>
    <li><strong>Printable PDF sheets:</strong> take the checklist onto the warehouse floor and make notes as you review.</li>
    <li><strong>Completed examples and a management review template:</strong> see how a stock investigation and provider review become findings, assigned work and decisions to follow up.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="audit-signup-preview" aria-label="Email signup preview, inactive">
    <label for={emailId}>Email address</label>
    <div class="audit-signup-fields">
      <input id={emailId} type="email" placeholder="Your email address" disabled />
      <button type="button" disabled>Subscribe &amp; get the audit pack</button>
    </div>
    <p class="audit-small">When the pack is available, you’ll be able to subscribe to DataDocks emails about warehouse guidance and product updates and receive the Excel and PDF files. Unsubscribe anytime. <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .audit-pack-content { padding: 1.25rem; }
  .audit-pack-content > p { font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .audit-pack-contents { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.25rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; }
  .audit-pack-contents li { margin: .5rem 0; }
  .audit-pack-art { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; max-width: 24rem; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 0; }
  .audit-pack-sheet, .audit-pack-workbook { border: 1px solid #e5d3b3; border-top: 5px solid #fd4f00; background: #fff8e9; color: #111; min-height: 13rem; padding: 1rem; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #e5d3b3; }
  .audit-pack-workbook { margin: 2rem 0 0 -.65rem; }
  .audit-pack-art span { display: block; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  .audit-pack-art strong { display: block; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.3; }
  .audit-pack-art p { font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: .8rem 0; }
  .audit-pack-art i { display: block; height: .4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #bca988; margin-top: .45rem; }
  .audit-sheet-lines { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .audit-sheet-lines i { height: .85rem; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0,transparent 31%,#e5d3b3 31%,#e5d3b3 32%); }
  .audit-signup-preview { margin: 1.75rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--audit-pack-line, #e5d3b3); container-type: inline-size; }
  .audit-signup-preview label { display: block; margin-bottom: .5rem; font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; }
  .audit-signup-fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); }
  .audit-signup-preview input { display: block; min-width: 0; width: 100%; min-height: 54px; padding: 12px 16px; background: #efe2d2; color: #000; border: 1px solid #cdbda8; border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 0; font: inherit; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.4; opacity: 1; -webkit-appearance: none; }
  .audit-signup-preview input::placeholder { color: #65533d; opacity: 1; }
  .audit-signup-preview button { display: block; min-height: 54px; padding: 12px 16px; background: #fe5000; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 0; font: inherit; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; text-shadow: none; cursor: default; opacity: 1; }
  .audit-signup-preview .audit-small { margin: .875rem 0 0; font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .audit-signup-preview a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
  .audit-signup-preview a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--audit-pack-accent, #fe5000); outline-offset: 3px; }
  @container (min-width: 32rem) {
    .audit-signup-fields { grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem,1fr) auto; }
    .audit-signup-preview input { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #cdbda8; }
    .audit-signup-preview button { white-space: nowrap; }
  }
</style>
